1
00:00:04,528 --> 00:00:05,320
Be careful!

2
00:00:22,453 --> 00:00:23,693
It's after the Seals!

3
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:29,300
For a cornered beast with no way out, hardly a surprising choice

4
00:00:30,307 --> 00:00:32,820
It seems that some losses are inevitable

5
00:00:33,304 --> 00:00:39,498
As this constitutes "force majeure," I'm afraid the contract excuses me from providing compensation

6
00:00:55,075 --> 00:00:58,639
Force majeure or not, I still have to try...

7
00:01:10,796 --> 00:01:13,015
I must caution you, Miss Vesna

8
00:01:13,409 --> 00:01:16,717
Borrowing too much power is a precarious move

9
00:01:17,338 --> 00:01:20,349
I understand. Even so...

10
00:01:20,709 --> 00:01:26,079
When that lady gave this power to my ancestors, perhaps the contract she made

11
00:01:26,079 --> 00:01:27,553
Was for this purpose

12
00:01:30,972 --> 00:01:36,990
That its custodian, when the time comes, should make a stand

13
00:01:41,276 --> 00:01:42,720
"Contract"...

14
00:02:24,710 --> 00:02:27,978
It's back up! How do we defeat this thing!?

15
00:02:27,978 --> 00:02:29,331
Vesna, look out!

16
00:02:36,626 --> 00:02:37,720
What the...

17
00:02:48,708 --> 00:02:50,167
...Your Majesty?

18
00:03:04,174 --> 00:03:04,904
...

19
00:03:09,744 --> 00:03:12,066
I was hoping to sit this out...

20
00:03:16,075 --> 00:03:19,772
But it seems I'll have to reclaim what is mine

21
00:03:22,377 --> 00:03:23,725
Care to stop me

22
00:03:24,401 --> 00:03:25,911
Your Majesty?

23
00:03:29,042 --> 00:03:35,505
In all this time, I've had no great ambition to recover my stolen morsel

24
00:03:36,745 --> 00:03:41,553
But if it were used to extract life, or even defy death...

25
00:03:42,264 --> 00:03:45,281
It would be a grave transgression

26
00:03:46,289 --> 00:03:48,404
Vesna, are you alright?

27
00:03:53,118 --> 00:03:53,884
...What do you want?

28
00:03:54,813 --> 00:03:59,789
People love to believe in the miraculous potential of human ingenuity...

29
00:04:01,149 --> 00:04:05,091
And yet... Human effort is mostly futile

